	(text "Pull-ups 10 kΩ to +3V3 on CS0-CS11, LATCH, OE, IRQ (R135-R148, R168);\n2 kΩ on SDA, SCL (R172-R173). Pull-downs 100 kΩ on SCK, MOSI, MISO\n(R169-R171): SPI mode 0 idle; MISO tri-stated with no module selected.\nSeries 49.9 Ω R149-R164; SCK, MOSI, LATCH: second 49.9 Ω in parallel\n(R165-R167), 25 Ω for the multipoint edges."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 154.94 0)
		(effects
