	(text "+VIN_BUS1, +VIN_BUS2: VIN_BUS on ribbon pins 33 and 34, one TPS27S100B per pin, 525 mA limit\n(4.7 kΩ, TI minimum 0.5 A), auto-retry. DIAG_EN high: IMON and protections always on.\nIMON = I/500 from each switch, joined on one 2 kΩ load; half to PF7: 0.96 A -> 1.92 V, fault 2.15-2.45 V."
